<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">2 Peter</book>
  <para style="h">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peter</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Peter</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Simon Peter, Jesu Khrist sikha leh sawltak in, Jesu Khrist, i Pathian leh Hondampa diktatna ziak a ginna mantamtak i tan bang tangsamte kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian leh i Toupa Jesu Khrist theihna tungtawn in hehpihna leh lemna noute sung ah hihkhan in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah thupina leh hoihna ziak a honsampa, a tanchin theih ziak in a Pathian thilhihtheihna in hinna leh Pathian limsakna lamthu ah thil tengteng a hon peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaite ziak in a thuchiam manphatak leh thupi mahmahte a honpia hi; huchi in utna ziak a khovel a siatna hongom taikhiak san in; huai thuchiam manphatak leh thupi mahmahte ziak in Pathian omdan na kikoppih thei sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, huaiziak tak in, thanop himhim suah in, na ginna uah hoihna hel unla, na hoihna uah theihna hel unla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na theihna uah kidekna hel unla, na kidekna uah kuhkalna hel unla, na kukhalna uah Pathian limsakna hel unla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na Pathian limsakna uah unaute itna hel unla, na unaute itna ah itna hel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaite nou a a hih a, a khanzel leh, i Toupa Jesu Khrist theihna lam ah thadahlou leh gahlou lou in nou a honbawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kuapeuh huai thilte neilou mittaw, naichikte kia muthei, a nidanglai khelhnate siansakna mangngilhte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in unaute aw, nou a honsapna leh a hontelna hihkip ding in thanop suah semsem un; huaite na hih uleh chiklai mah in na puk kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Jesu Khrist i Toupa leh Hondampa’n tangtawn gam a lutna a hon musak law mahmah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in huai thilte nei in na kiang ua om thutak a phuhkip hitamah le uchin, huai thutak mah k’on theisak nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan hiai sapum a ka omlai teng noumau hon theihpih in hon tohhalh gige hoih ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist in hon theihsak bang in ka sapum puanin koihkhiak hun ding hongtung pah ding chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi ka paikhiak nung in huai thilte na theihgigena ding un ka kisuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist thilhihtheihna leh a hong paina thu k’on theihsak lai un, tangthu piltak a ngaihtuah khiakphet zui ka hi kei ua, a thupina mute ka hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman Pa Pathian kiang a kipan in pahtawina leh thupina a mu a, huchihlai in thupina thupitak a kipan in hichibang aw a kiang a hongtung hi, “Hiai ka Tapa deihtak, ka kipahna mahmah ahi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan tang siangthou a a kiang a ka om ziak un huai aw van a kipan a hongsuak koumau ngei in ka za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in genkholhna thu kipnawn sem i nei uhi. Khua a hongvak a, zingsol aksi na lungtang ua a hongsuah masiah hiai thu khawnvak mun mial a vak a limsak bang ua, na limsak uleh na hih hoih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Laisiangthou a thugenkholh himhim eimah kihilhchian ding ahi kei chih thei masa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thugenkholh himhim mihing thu a pawt ahi ngeikei a, mite’n Kha Siangthou sawl in, Pathian a kipan a genzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh mite lak ah zawlnei takloute leng a hongpawt ua, huchi mah bang in na lak uah heute takloute a hongom ding uhi, amaute leipa Toupa hilhial tawpsan in mi hihsethei ginna tuam a guk in a hon lutpih ding ua, amau tung ah thakhat in manthatna a tungsak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tampi in a zautatna lam thil uh a honching ding ua, amau ziak in lampi dik gensiat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sum deihna ziak in zuauthu in sumsinna ding in nou a honzang ding uh; himahleh nidanglai a omsa a mohtanna ding uh a khawl kei a, a manthatna uh leng a ihmu kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Angelte’n thil a hihkhelh un Pathian in a hawikei a, gawtmun ah a pai a, vaihawm ding in guam khukthuk mial ah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah limsakloute omna khovel ah tuichim tungsak in, nidanglai khovel a hawikei a, himahleh Noah diktatna thugenpa midang sagih toh a hondamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sodom leh Gomorrah khuate amah limsaklou hongom dingte etsakna ding in a zang a, vut suaksak in hih mangthang in siamlouh a tangsakta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan Lot midiktat, migiloute omdan huktak ziak a lungkham mahmahpa a hondamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai mi diktatpa a lak ua a om in, a mit in a mu a, a bil in a za a, danlou bang a a thilhihte un a lungsim diktat niteng in a hihna mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n amah limsakmite khemna apat hotkhiak dan leh diktatloute vaihawm ni ading a gawt kawm a hawidan a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Utna thanghuai lam a sa bang a om leh, vaihawm sakna musitmite ngialhouh vaihawmni ading a gawt kawm a hawidan a theisem hi. Haihan leh chihhak ahi ua a mi thupite a gensiat un leng a ling kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Angel hatna leh thilhihtheihna neite’n amaute dem in Toupa ma ah a gense ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh hiaite’n bel ganhing ngaihtuahna neilou, mat a hihman dingte bang in, thil a theihlouhte uh a gensia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau diktatlouhna gahlou in a segawp ding ua, sun tanglai a zu leh sa kham a buai nuamsa mi ahi uh. Na kiang ua Ankuang a lui un, amau kikhemna Ankuanglui a hih ziak un, thanghuaina gensiatna ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mit angkawm a dim, khelhna tawpsan theiloute a nei ua; mi kiploute a khempuk ua; en hat lungsim a pu ua; hamsethuak tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Boer tapa Balaam, thilhih khelhna, loh deihpa lampi a tot ziak un lam dik paisan in a vakmang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh amah a tatlekna ziak in taihilh in a omta a; sabiltung pau theilou mihing pau in a hongpau a, zawlnei haina a kham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiaite tuikhuk tui omlou leh tuimei huihpi mut leng ahi ua; amaute ading in nuailam mial sah meuhmouh sit ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuginalou chiakzen a gen in gitlouhna lak a kipan a taikhete sa utna ah hukna in a khempuk nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amau siatna sikha hikawm pi in mite sikha suahtakna thu a chiam nak uhi; mite’n zohsa a chihte mah in amau sikha in a bawl nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa leh Hondampa Jesu Khrist a theih ziak ua khovel thanghuainate a taikhiaksan nung ua, huai mah a a tannawn ua, zoh a a om nawn ua leh zaw, a omdan nanung uh amasa sang in a hong hoihkei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Diktatna lampi pen theihnung a, thupiak siangthou a kiang ua kepsak nungngatsan sang in, diktatna lampi theilou hile uh amau ading in a hoihzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ui amah luak ah a kiknawn a, vawkpi kisil siangsa leng buannawi ah kisil ding in a kiknawn chih paunak diktak amau tung ah a tungta hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, tua na kiang ua ka gelh laikhak nihna ahi. Hiai tegel ah theihthaknawnna in na lungsim siang uh ka tokthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zawlnei siangthoute thugen kholh leh na sawltakte uh kam a Toupa leh Hondampa thupiak na theihgigena ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai thei masa un, ni nanungte ah, mi simmohhatte amau utna bang a om in, simmawh kawm in a hongpai ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A hongpai nawnna thuchiam koi ah? Siam tung a kipan bangkim a om ngeingei bang in pi leh pute ihmut ni a kipan in a om zel a! a honchi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thu in nidanglai in vante a hongom a chih a kitheihmohbawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leitung tui a kipan leh tui zang a bawl ahi a, huai tui mah in a tum a, a mangthangta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh tua vante leh lei omte huai thu mah in Pathian limsaklou mite vaihawm leh manthat ni ading a sit in mei hihsiat ding a kholkhawm ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh deihtakte aw, hiai thu kamkhat pen mangngilh kei un, Toupa ngaih in ni khat tuh kum sang khat bang ahi a, huan kum sang khat leng ni khat bang ahi, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi khenkhat in zekai a sak bang un Toupa zaw a thuchiam ah a zekai kei hi; kuamah manthat deihlou a, mi tengteng hong kisik deih in noumau lam ah a dohzou zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa ni zaw guta bang in a hongtung ding; huai ni chiang in van nakpitak a ging in a mangthang ding, thilbulte mei a haitui in a om ding a, lei leh a sung a nasep omte, a kangtum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai thilte huchibang a mangthang vek ding uh ahi chih na theih un, omdan siangthou leh Pathian limsakna lam ah mi bangchibang hi ding na hi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ni hongtung ding lamen leh phatuamngai tak in nawh un; huai ni a tun ziak in van hongkang in a mangthang dia, thilbulte leng mei a haltui in a omta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh a thuchiam bang in van thak leh lei thak, a sung a diktatna omte i lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in deihtakte aw, huai bang thilte na lamet ziak un nin banglou leh gensiatbei in, khamuangtak a na om uh a hon muhtheihna ding in thanop suah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan i unaupa deihtak Paul in leng a kiang a pilna piak bangzel a na kiang ua a gelh bang in Toupa dohzawhna hotdamna in sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A laikhak tengteng ah huai thute gen in, huai mah bang in a gelh hi. Huai ah thu theihhak thu thukte a om a, huaite mi pillou leh mi kiploute’n Laisiangthou dang a ngaikoi bang un a ngaikoi ua, amau leh amau siatna ding in a zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in deihtakte aw, noute’n tua thute na theihkholh ziak un pilvang un, huchilou in zaw migiloute diklouhna a pimang a om in, na kipna ua kipan na pukkha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh i Toupa leh Hondampa Jesu Khrist hehpihna leh theihna ah hong khang un. Tu leh tangtawn in amah kiang ah thupina om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
